{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37445","headline":"寄蒋二十四 · 唐彦谦","name":"寄蒋二十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸟啭蜂飞日渐长，旅人情味悔思量。\n禅门澹薄无心地，世事生疎欲面墙。\n二月云烟迷柳色，九衢风土带花香。\n大知高士禁愁寂，试倚阑干莫断肠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐彦谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37445.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37445","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}